message: "If you use Rocket Calculator in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Rocket Calculator: interactive sounding-rocket engineering calculators"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Rahmat Samii"
    given-names: "Dara"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RocketCalculator/RocketCalculator.github.io"
url: "https://rocketcalculator.github.io/"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords: [rocketry, sounding rockets, aerospace engineering, calculator, education]
abstract: >-
  Interactive calculators for sounding-rocket design (stability, drag, fin flutter, nozzles, recovery, trajectory and
  more), built from the rocket-engineering reports of C. P. Hoult, with verdicts, scaled drawings, plots and theory.
